 # URL Shortener
 
-Workspace created by the agentic SDLC orchestrator.
+A production-minded URL shortener (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0 async, Alembic). Built and evolved by the agentic SDLC orchestrator; every change traces to a run in `runs/`.
+
+## Run
+
+```bash
+uvicorn service.app:create_app --factory --port 8000
+```
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Summary |
+|---|---|---|
+| GET | `/healthz` | Liveness probe |
+| GET | `/readyz` | Readiness probe (database reachable) |
+| POST | `/api/v1/links` | create link |
+| GET | `/api/v1/links/{code}` | get link |
+| PATCH | `/api/v1/links/{code}` | update link |
+| DELETE | `/api/v1/links/{code}` | delete link |
+| GET | `/{code}` | follow |
+
+Full reference: `docs/service/API.md`; OpenAPI: `docs/openapi.json`.
+
+## Configuration
+
+All settings are environment variables with the `SHORTENER_` prefix:
+
+- `SHORTENER_ALLOW_PRIVATE_HOSTS`
+- `SHORTENER_APP_NAME`
+- `SHORTENER_BASE_URL`
+- `SHORTENER_CODE_LENGTH`
+- `SHORTENER_CODE_MAX_ATTEMPTS`
+- `SHORTENER_CORS_ORIGINS`
+- `SHORTENER_DATABASE_URL`
+- `SHORTENER_DB_AUTO_MIGRATE`
+- `SHORTENER_DB_POOL_SIZE`
+- `SHORTENER_ENVIRONMENT`
+- `SHORTENER_HSTS_ENABLED`
+- `SHORTENER_LOG_JSON`
+- `SHORTENER_LOG_LEVEL`
+- `SHORTENER_MAX_REQUEST_BODY_BYTES`
+- `SHORTENER_MAX_URL_LENGTH`
+- `SHORTENER_REDIRECT_STATUS_CODE`
+
+## Requirements implemented
+
+Latest change: **REQ-GF-001 - URL shortener core service**
+
+- Create short links via POST /api/v1/links with optional custom alias and tags; support Idempotency-Key.
+- Redirect GET /{code} to the target URL (302 by default, 307 configurable); 404 for unknown codes, 410 for disabled or deleted links.
+- Read link metadata via GET /api/v1/links/{code}; disable via PATCH; soft delete via DELETE.
+- Liveness (GET /healthz) and readiness (GET /readyz, checks the database) probes.
+- Persist links in a relational database managed by reversible migrations.
